  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2905.04 Transfer Validation. The ATS administrator shall record allowance transfers determined to be valid, through verification by the ATS administrator, in the ATS by deducting the specified allowances from the originating account and adding the allowances to the acquiring account.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2907.06); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
